# The CI runner is Linux and executes apply.sh / check-dts.sh with /bin/sh.
# A CRLF in those files shows up only after a push, as
#   /bin/sh^M: bad interpreter
# which is a slow way to find out. Pin the line ending here so the result no
# longer depends on core.autocrlf on whatever machine does the commit.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.mk text eol=lf
*.dts text eol=lf
*.dtsi text eol=lf
